{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reserve parent completion before offloading late child results.** The two completion checks are separated by serialization/offloading. With early map/parallel completion, the parent can finish between them, causing a late child to write an external payload and then suppress its checkpoint, leaving an unreferenced side effect. Coordinate an atomic \u201ccompletion initiated\u201d state with child persistence before offloading, and add an early-completion race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odJfp","finding_digest":"f80a77f2286ba9c66b27fe9c2ea342f8f1460dc8eedace21a55ccf090ba34e4f","finding_id":"arf_v1_7afhp4rinou4m2zh72oc5i2c7d","finding_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextsuccess::late-child-offload-side-effect","identity_key":"sdk/operation/childcontextoperation::handlechildcontextsuccess::late-child-offload-side-effect","line":156,"observation_digest":"34cea04839df80a528eeed61cc94b0dd3268377c21cf31f065b27f82ab211d91","observation_id":"aro_v1_gthkasbz36akkkho5vq4zffq3u","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vlvjn3k2bg6cxoepbwrwc2slgw","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"88bc34d2d082149d899d22adc7327b4f4d12ef4c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":156,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_gpx352rjmjwrqol63ez5ww6uca","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
